@page
@model countrybitweb.Pages.RevolutionTrainingModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Revolution Training";
}

<style>
    .rt-doom-scroll {
        max-height: 85vh;
        overflow-y: auto;
        scroll-snap-type: y mandatory;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: .5rem;
        background: #0f0f12;
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }

    .rt-shot {
        scroll-snap-align: start;
        margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #1b1b21;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
    }

    .rt-shot:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .rt-shot img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        max-height: 78vh;
        object-fit: contain;
        background: #0a0a0d;
    }

    .rt-shot h4 {
        margin: 0;
        padding: .75rem 1rem;
        color: #f0f0f0;
        font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .rt-store-link {
        position: relative;
        display: inline-block;
        width: min(100%, 560px);
        margin: .5rem 0 1rem 0;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 2px solid #0a84ff;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .rt-store-link:focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid #7fb8ff;
        outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .rt-store-image {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
    }

    .rt-store-overlay {
        position: absolute;
        inset: auto 0 0 0;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: .75rem;
        padding: .8rem 1rem;
        background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,.78), rgba(0,0,0,.12));
        color: #fff;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .rt-store-cta {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: .35rem .7rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.9);
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(10,132,255,.85);
        color: #fff;
        font-size: .9rem;
        line-height: 1;
        white-space: nowrap;
    }
</style>

<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
<!--<a style="font-size:20px; color:darkgreen;" href="https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9mw7vxj5l36r?hl=en-US&gl=US">See in the Microsoft Store</a>-->


<h3>We should hope his majesty might feel this to be a quite intense role play for the discerning audience.</h3>
<p>
    You must improve yourself first to fight injustice.  Revolution Training puts you on the path to take the country
    back from the gatekeepers and narcissists in power holding you down. 
    In this intense simulation, you'll be able to practice building your own Revolution as you are trained to train others.
    You'll work out, learn music, and study the arts and sciences.  You'll identify people and their traits, and you'll 
    learn to deal with classic gatekeeper and parasite power moves with a strategy that is sane and organized 
    among the free people.  You will stand up to Russian Assets, Confederates, Woke SJWs, whatever hate filled gatekeeper that
    thinks they can put you down to keep you out, and then blasphemes that they do so in your name.
</p>

<p>
    Accept the mission and being monitoring the incursions of the Enemy into the minds of the West.  Handy links
    are provided to keep you abrest of the movements of the Enemy, from Russian invasions and threats to Confederate
    and other White Supremist movements to other Racial supremist movements as well. The enemy is everywhere, but you'll never miss a beat.
</p>

<p>
    Begin your training.  Take your mind, body, and spirit to their absolute peak.  Revolution Journal provides
    motivational tools for you to take recommended training actions from exploring liminal spaces to meditate and pray,
    learning music and art, to try new things and meet people. You'll go outside and say hello more.  You'll lift more weights and
    do more aerobics, and you will study comparitive religions and philosophies, read more books, and learn more about
    math and chemistry and science and the engineering process.
</p>

<p>
    You will become a Constellation Knight, intelligent and strong, educated and wise, working to create a new mythology
    for the USA as we reboot the entire society into a new national spiritual movement comprised by the best of all of them.
</p>

<ol>
    <li>You may still be afraid when dealing with toxic people, but you will not lose.</li>
    <li>You will not run any more.</li>
    <li>As you win, you will gain confidence.</li>
    <li>You will bend toxic people to your will.</li>
    <li>You will stay on the path of justice when you do.</li>
    <li>You will save them.</li>
    <li>They will save you.</li>
</ol>

<a class="rt-store-link"
   href="https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9p8b1lrxnq27?hl=en-US&gl=US"
   aria-label="View Revolution Training in Microsoft Store">
    <img class="rt-store-image"
         src="images/revolutiontraining/carousel_poster.png"
         alt="Revolution Training on Microsoft Store"
         loading="lazy" />
    <span class="rt-store-overlay">
        <span>Revolution Training</span>
        <span class="rt-store-cta">View in Microsoft Store</span>
    </span>
</a>

<h3>Handcrafted, Small and Fast</h3>
<p>
    Revolution Journal was written in powerful C++ directly to the Windows operating
    system. It can run on just about any PC.
</p>

<h3>Where to Buy</h3>
<p>
    Revolution Journal is at the Microsoft Store.
</p>

<h3>About the Author</h3>
<p>
    Revolution Journal was written by Todd Bandrowsky, of Bowling Green, KY.
</p>

